## Measured on the rendered file

- **Format:** 1024x576 H.264 High, 24 fps, 15800 frames; AAC-LC 48 kHz stereo; 658.333 s. An ffmpeg full decode reported 0 errors.
- **Placement** (`edit/tools/place.py`): for every shot, I compared the cut's middle frame with the same frame of the supplied clip. PSNR is at least 37.8 dB on S001–S126, and in each shot it is higher than against the neighbouring frame. S127 is the credits.
- **Motion** (`edit/tools/motion.py`, `cut-v6-motion.json`):
  - **Method:** I counted new pictures per second, meaning frames whose mean absolute luma difference from the previous frame is above 0.3, over the full decode.
  - **qc's 17 stepped shots (editor#14):** they measured 4.0–16.9/s in cut-v5 with the same script. In cut-v6, 16 of them measure 22.2–24.0/s, and S126 measures 18.9/s.
  - **Other shots:** every other shot is 24.0/s, except the S127 credits roll at 19.3/s.
- **Sync:** I cross-correlated 4 s of the cut's audio with `mix.wav` at 30, 300 and 600 s. The offset was 0.0 ms each time (correlation 0.9987–0.9996).
- **Loudness:** integrated −19.8 LUFS, LRA 8.4 LU.

